+To check which agent runtimes are installed, run the `runtimes` command of the xvant CLI:
+
+```sh
+npm run xvant -- runtimes
+npm run xvant -- runtimes --json
+```
+
+Without `--json`, it prints one plain-text line per runtime (codex, claude, opencode). With `--json`, it prints a single JSON array to stdout with one object per runtime (codex, claude, opencode). Each object has the keys `runtimeKind`, `status`, `version` and `executable`; `version` and `executable` are a string or `null`.
